			<task label="hw-while-fibonacci">
				<title>Fibonacci Threshold</title>

				<statement>
					<p>
						Write a script that uses a <pf>while</pf> loop to generate Fibonacci numbers until one exceeds 
						10000. The Fibonacci sequence starts with 0 and 1, and each subsequent number is the sum of the 
						two preceding numbers. Store the first Fibonacci number that exceeds 10000 in <pf>fib_result</pf>. 
						You will need variables for the current number and the two previous numbers.
					</p>

					<tabular valign="top" halign="right" top="minor">
