						where each number is the sum of the two preceding numbers.
					</p>
					<p>
						Write a MATLAB script that:
						<ol>
							<li>Uses a <pf>while</pf>-loop to generate Fibonacci numbers until one exceeds 10,000.</li>
							<li>Displays each Fibonacci number as it is computed.</li>
							<li>Reports which Fibonacci number was the first to exceed 10,000.</li>
						</ol>
