						<em>Hint:</em> You only need three variables: the current Fibonacci number, the previous one, and the one before that. Use a pattern like:
					</p>
					<program language="matlab">
						prev2 = 0;
						prev1 = 1;

						while prev1 &lt; 10000
							current = prev2 + prev1;
							% display and update variables
						end
